  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Thread mitsuba, chicken, and pork fat onto skewers",
    "In a small bowl mix together smoked paprika, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper",
    "Brush the skewers with the spice mixture",
    "Grill the skewers for 10 minutes per side",
    "Brush the skewers with lemon juice during the last minute of grilling",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving",
    "Serve the skewers hot and enjoy"
